sequenceDiagram
    participant Sweep as Deadline sweeper
    participant Orders as Order service
    participant Admin as Admin Service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Kafka as Kafka

    loop every 5 seconds
        Sweep->>Orders: ACCEPTED past the collection window
        Orders->>DB: clear courier, back to CREATED
        Sweep->>Orders: CREATED past acceptance expiry
        Orders->>DB: EXPIRED, outbox credit.reservation.return
        Sweep->>Orders: COLLECTED past the delivery deadline
        Orders->>Admin: POST /api/v1/admin/conflicts
        Orders->>DB: ESCALATED, log, alert, status outbox
        Sweep->>Orders: DELIVERED past the acknowledgement window
        Orders->>DB: UNACKNOWLEDGED, credit release, rating permission
        Sweep->>Orders: settled 7 days ago
        Orders->>DB: delete photos, COMPLETED, requester is not notified
        Sweep->>Kafka: publish up to 50 unpublished outbox rows
    end
